OL,5,G2000 Our Tiny Islands
OL,6,     FThe British Isles uniquely boasts,
OL,7,     F4000 islands off of its coasts.
OL,8,     FToday we'll ride Sark's
OL,9,     Fhorse-drawn gigs, and meet
OL,10,     FFermanagh's special pigs.
OL,11,     F#NationalPoetryDay
OL,12,G2100 Taskmaster
OL,13,     FThere once was a whizz-kid called
OL,14,     FNina, who was certain that no one
OL,15,     Fhad seen 'er, cheat in a test,
OL,16,     FAlex Horne did his best, but Conti
OL,17,     Fhad a cunning demeanour.
OL,18,     F#NationalPoetryDay
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG1/6
