OL,5,G2200 Break Clause
OL,6,     FAugust: Romcom series with Samuel
OL,7,     FBottomley and Lara Ricote. Their
OL,8,     Frelationship's over. Their tenancy
OL,9,     Fisn't. In a six-month contract,
OL,10,     FBen and Lil are imprisoned.
OL,11,     F(Ep1/6) #NationalPoetryDay
OL,12,G2230 Break Clause
OL,13,     FSeptember: Romcom. Lil decides to
OL,14,     Fgo on a date, move on from Ben
OL,15,     Fwith a clean slate. Brings a guy
OL,16,     Fto the flat, with just one caveat:
OL,17,     FLil's ex is also her roommate.
OL,18,     F(Ep2) #NationalPoetryDay
