OL,5,G0335 Travel Man: 48 Hours in Dublin
OL,6,     FIn Dublin, Joe Lycett and comedian
OL,7,     FMawaan Rizwan visit talking
OL,8,     Fstatues, swim in
OL,9,     F'scrotum-tightening' waters, and
OL,10,     Fswig stout at the Guinness
OL,11,     FStorehouse.
OL,12,G0405 Location, Location, Location
OL,13,     FKirstie and Phil are on the south
OL,14,     Fcoast. Jo and Kev want an
OL,15,     Fadaptable home suited to their
OL,16,     Fdaughter Cody, who has cerebral
OL,17,     Fpalsy. Alice and Jack are
OL,18,     Fsearching in pricey Worthing.
